# Do not let Prettier format the docs markdown.
#
# Prettier treats the raw content of Hugo shortcodes as prose, which silently
# corrupts it and breaks the Hugo build:
#   * {{< chart >}} blocks contain JavaScript. Prettier escaped `(_, i)` to
#     `(\_, i)` and rewrote the multiplication `1.2 *x* x` to `1.2 _x_ x`,
#     because both look like markdown emphasis.
#   * {{< katex >}} blocks and inline \\( ... \\) math contain `_` subscripts
#     and `*`, which are vulnerable in exactly the same way.
#
# Formatting these files is not worth the risk of a broken deploy, so keep
# them out of Prettier entirely. Format markdown by hand here.
content/
